  "bunnyboard": {
    "conversations": {
      "venus": {
        "charId": "venus",
        "messages": [
          {
            "id": "a91a33bb-80c0-4753-a01e-472334ed630c",
            "sender": "contact",
            "text": "Hi Theo! I'm Venus, the university's assistant. I can help you change your classes and will remind you of important dates coming up during the semester.",
            "date": 0,
            "time": 1
          },
          {
            "id": "d30f1469-8ee2-4ede-8b1e-1fa37c346f99",
            "sender": "contact",
            "text": "If you want to change classes, you have until Friday, February 13 — the add/drop deadline — to change it. The button below will take you to the scheduling website.",
            "date": 0,
            "time": 1
          },
          {
            "id": "05d3dcce-7b7e-47be-9412-00711132f808",
            "sender": "contact",
            "text": "Keep in mind that you need at least 3 regular classes plus a PE class to stay enrolled, 7 classes at most, and if you drop a class you won't be able to enroll in it again this semester.",
            "date": 0,
            "time": 1
          },
          {
            "id": "49db7182-fe57-47a6-98fe-746f5f558621",
            "sender": "contact",
            "text": "Concordia et Prosperitas. Welcome to campus!",
            "date": 0,
            "time": 1
          },
          {
            "id": "6709ff3a-f9bf-4a02-94f5-5910600f91e4",
            "sender": "contact",
            "text": "Hey Theo, did you know that there are many places on and off-campus that hire VU students?",
            "date": 1,
            "time": 1
          },
          {
            "id": "4de16342-9cc6-4ca3-975e-7e19c78ffaba",
            "sender": "contact",
            "text": "Part-time employment isn't just a great way to put some extra dollars in your pocket. It's also a fun way to improve skills and meet people.",
            "date": 1,
            "time": 1
          },
          {
            "id": "7f53fef1-5589-4f34-a48d-e03be26fbf83",
            "sender": "contact",
            "text": "Interested? I can help you apply for a part-time job. Just click the button below.",
            "date": 1,
            "time": 1
          },
          {
            "id": "e68184f3-38b8-4483-a220-190ff98f7c38",
            "sender": "contact",
            "text": "How's your first week been, Theo? Remember to keep up with your coursework! By the way, there are two types of classes: lecture classes and project classes.",
            "date": 8,
            "time": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "efc87769-bb7b-4825-aca3-3b7977827790",
            "sender": "contact",
            "text": "For lecture classes, you'll have a midterm and a final. Study hard and improve your Brains if you want a good grade. And if your professor says something will be on an exam, you should probably note it down.",
            "date": 8,
            "time": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "2def6f91-8a19-4410-b321-e5ac70237e57",
            "sender": "contact",
            "text": "For project classes, you'll have a final showcase instead of an exam. If you work on your project every week, you'll avoid having to crunch when the deadline approaches. And it definitely helps to have high Heart so you can present your project effectively.",
            "date": 8,
            "time": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "055e21d2-025d-43b5-9d18-d7c2778c837d",
            "sender": "contact",
            "text": "Midterms run March 2 to March 6. Good luck! Wishing you \"Concordia et Prosperitas.\"",
            "date": 8,
            "time": 0
          }
        ],
        "unread": 11,
        "summary": null
      },
      "bunnybot": {
        "charId": "bunnybot",
        "messages": [
          {
            "id": "057d80bb-3b36-49a3-92d3-14e84fc32f80",
            "sender": "contact",
            "text": "sup theo, i'm bunny_bot. your friends list is looking a little slim, huh? don't stress, i'm here to help",
            "date": 1,
            "time": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "52e49eed-6609-48ac-831f-b088aa3d4adf",
            "sender": "contact",
            "text": "i suggested some people you may know on the friends tab... go ahead and send them a request. if they don't accept after a day or two, you probably need to work on your Heart or get closer to them offline",
            "date": 1,
            "time": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "ec522199-d6c1-4b70-bc08-768e51e87898",
            "sender": "contact",
            "text": "you can also just ask people you meet for their number or contact info. i'll auto-add them to your contacts list",
            "date": 1,
            "time": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "73887953-6aa0-45d8-8548-06edb74ccee2",
            "sender": "contact",
            "text": "nice job nabbing your first friend contact, hotshot. make sure to text them often (but not too often) to stay close",
            "date": 3,
            "time": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "0343e6b8-f641-4d6b-89d5-667d2da1f4b9",
            "sender": "contact",
            "text": "and if you happen to have free time, why not ask them to hang out? though don't be surprised if you get turned down cuz they don't know you well enough yet",
            "date": 3,
            "time": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "7c02f255-75b5-49ae-bb14-ed46f8807895",
            "sender": "contact",
            "text": "i also added the BunnyMap app to your sidebar, since you have access to their location updates now. i'm not saying to stalk them... i'm just letting you know where to hang out if you wanna run into them",
            "date": 3,
            "time": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "0386fc1a-79f4-4cdc-a9eb-ef4568693432",
            "sender": "contact",
            "text": "have you been keeping up with the updates tab? looks like celest just posted",
            "date": 4,
            "time": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "b23bde4e-0717-4c02-ac3c-b87022d4256b",
            "sender": "contact",
            "text": "why not go leave a like? people love getting a little love. liking old posts won't do much, but liking new ones will keep you on their radar",
            "date": 4,
            "time": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "4c3cb4cd-452c-44d3-8a65-609863ab7218",
            "sender": "contact",
            "text": "that money burning a hole in your pocket yet? why not buy a gift for someone? i added the BunnyShop app to your sidebar just now",
            "date": 5,
            "time": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "a57ec08a-6328-4935-82da-3810221a13d5",
            "sender": "contact",
            "text": "a gift is a great way to show your appreciation for someone and get closer to them... as long as you choose something they'd actually like",
            "date": 5,
            "time": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "939b6de1-adbb-477a-9f1f-f2c7a0ce2afb",
            "sender": "contact",
            "text": "you can give a gift to a girl when you're meeting them face-to-face via the gift icon next to the response box",
            "date": 5,
            "time": 0
          }
        ],
        "unread": 11,
        "summary": null
      },
